// # Compiler Optimization, Intermediate Representation and Virtual Machines Facade
//
// Logline: Unified standard library facade re-exporting SSA optimizations, register allocators, Wasm/ELF/Mach-O binary encoders, and bytecode virtual machines.
//
// Setup: Pure module shim importing all 49 compiler and virtual machine companion submodules.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import SSA analysis, optimization passes, register allocation, binary formats, and VM runtimes.
//   2. Re-export typed public constructors and execution facade helpers.
//   3. Maintain standard unified entry point for compiler optimization and VM subsystems.

